    - target: {fileID: 3290039904537624143, guid: e4d7cbca6a9615e499283407e44e6998, type: 3}
      propertyPath: convos.Array.data[0].myName
      value: Intro
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3290039904537624143, guid: e4d7cbca6a9615e499283407e44e6998, type: 3}
      propertyPath: convos.Array.data[0].sentences.Array.size
      value: 16
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3290039904537624143, guid: e4d7cbca6a9615e499283407e44e6998, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'convos.Array.data[0].sentences.Array.data[0]'
      value: "Hmm\u2026"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3290039904537624143, guid: e4d7cbca6a9615e499283407e44e6998, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'convos.Array.data[0].sentences.Array.data[1]'
      value: "The tides shift, the winds whisper\u2026"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3290039904537624143, guid: e4d7cbca6a9615e499283407e44e6998, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'convos.Array.data[0].sentences.Array.data[2]'
      value: and here you are.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3290039904537624143, guid: e4d7cbca6a9615e499283407e44e6998, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'convos.Array.data[0].sentences.Array.data[3]'
      value: Muktuk feels something is wrong, a tremor in the water, a taste of unease
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3290039904537624143, guid: e4d7cbca6a9615e499283407e44e6998, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'convos.Array.data[0].sentences.Array.data[4]'
      value: 'And if the sea is restless, the world will soon follow. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3290039904537624143, guid: e4d7cbca6a9615e499283407e44e6998, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'convos.Array.data[0].sentences.Array.data[5]'
      value: You have just begun, but the strong currents already pull you towards
        something greater.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3290039904537624143, guid: e4d7cbca6a9615e499283407e44e6998, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'convos.Array.data[0].sentences.Array.data[6]'
      value: 'Oh, Muktuk completely forgot to do a proper introduction. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3290039904537624143, guid: e4d7cbca6a9615e499283407e44e6998, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'convos.Array.data[0].sentences.Array.data[7]'
      value: Muktuk is Muktuk!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3290039904537624143, guid: e4d7cbca6a9615e499283407e44e6998, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'convos.Array.data[0].sentences.Array.data[8]'
      value: "The Wise whale, Wanderer of the seas, Plankton specialist\u2026"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3290039904537624143, guid: e4d7cbca6a9615e499283407e44e6998, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'convos.Array.data[0].sentences.Array.data[9]'
      value: but today Muktuk will also be your guide.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3290039904537624143, guid: e4d7cbca6a9615e499283407e44e6998, type: 3}
